# CR 117.1b, ADR-0019 Decision point 5: an activated ability with no
# SorcerySpeed$ is instant speed, so a non-active player can activate it in
# response. human bolts ai's Prodigal Pyromancer; ai, holding priority with
# Bolt on the stack, taps the Pyromancer to ping human before it dies. The
# ping resolves first (CR 117.4, top of the stack), then Bolt kills the
# Pyromancer through CR 704.5g.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets 3
queue targets human
queue action human cast 1
queue action ai activate 3 0
passpriority
